# PHASE 0 — PROJECT BRIEF

## Client profile

Local craft-based company providing **custom furniture (meble na wymiar)** in **Strzelce Krajeńskie**.

## Primary business goal

Build a professional website acting as:

- company business card,
- portfolio of completed projects,
- local lead generator,
- with **phone call as the main conversion**.

## Target users

- Homeowners and apartment owners in Strzelce Krajeńskie and nearby towns.
- People planning kitchens, wardrobes, built-ins or other custom furniture.
- Interior designers and renovation contractors looking for a reliable local partner.

## MVP functional scope (must-have)

- Homepage with hero, services, portfolio preview, testimonials, phone CTA.
- Offer section with individual service pages.
- Portfolio (projects listing + project detail pages) with category filtering.
- About page.
- Contact page with phone + address + map.
- Sticky phone CTA (desktop header + mobile floating button).

## Optional / Phase 2

- Contact forms and CRM integration.
- Headless CMS (Strapi / Directus).
- Multi-language support (Astroplate ready).

## Technology assumptions

- Astro + React Islands.
- Tailwind CSS for styling.
- Astro Content Collections for content (file-based initially).
- Static-first rendering, minimal JavaScript.
- Deployment: Vercel / Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.

## Core KPI

- Phone call conversion rate.
- Local Google ranking for "meble na wymiar Strzelce Krajeńskie".
- Lighthouse Performance ≥ 90.

## Core UX rule

Every page must clearly guide the user toward **calling the company**.

