# PHASE 1 — INFORMATION ARCHITECTURE

## Final sitemap

```
/
├── Home
├── Offer
│   ├── Kitchens (Kuchnie na wymiar)
│   ├── Wardrobes & Closets (Szafy i garderoby)
│   ├── Built-ins (Zabudowy wnętrz)
│   └── Other projects (Inne realizacje)
├── Projects (Portfolio / Realizacje)
├── About (O nas)
└── Contact (Kontakt)
```

## Navigation principles

- Maximum 5 main menu items.
- Sticky header with visible phone CTA.
- Dropdown for Offer and Projects categories.
- Mobile hamburger menu + floating call button.

## Projects filtering concept

Projects page supports category filtering:

```
/projects
/projects?category=kitchens
/projects?category=wardrobes
/projects?category=builtins
/projects?category=other
```

Filtering must work without full page reload (React Island).

## Content hierarchy (global)

1. What the company does (custom furniture / meble na wymiar).
2. Why trust them (experience + testimonials).
3. Proof of work (portfolio of realizations).
4. Easy contact (phone CTA everywhere).

## User flow examples

### Flow A — direct buyer

```
Google → Service page → Phone CTA → Call
```

### Flow B — inspiration seeker

```
Google → Projects → Filter → Project detail → Phone CTA → Call
```

### Flow C — trust builder

```
Google → Home → Testimonials → About → Phone CTA → Call
```

