# PHASE 3 — UI COMPONENT LIBRARY (Astro + React Islands)

This phase defines the component architecture to be implemented in Cursor using **Astro + React Islands + Tailwind CSS**.

## General conventions

- Components stored in `src/components/`
- Import alias: `@/components/...`
- Static layout components → Astro
- Interactive elements → React Islands with hydration directives
- Mobile-first Tailwind styling

## Folder structure

```
src/components/
  common/
    Header.astro
    Footer.astro
    CallToAction.astro
    PageHeader.astro
    StickyCallButton.astro
    SEOHead.astro
  hero/
    HeroSection.astro
  services/
    ServicesGrid.astro
    ServiceCard.astro
  portfolio/
    PortfolioFilters.jsx
    PortfolioGrid.astro
    ProjectCard.astro
    ProjectGallery.jsx
    ProjectMeta.astro
  testimonials/
    TestimonialsSlider.jsx
  about/
    AboutContent.astro
    WorkshopGallery.astro
  contact/
    ContactDetails.astro
    MapEmbed.astro
```

---

## Core components

### Header.astro

**Type:** Astro

**Purpose:** Sticky main navigation with phone CTA.

**Props:**

```ts
interface HeaderProps {
  siteTitle: string;
  phone: string;
  navItems: {
    title: string;
    href: string;
    children?: { title: string; href: string }[];
  }[];
}
```

**Behavior:**

- Sticky on scroll
- Desktop dropdown for Offer + Projects
- Mobile hamburger menu
- Always visible phone link (`tel:`)

---

### HeroSection.astro

**Type:** Astro

**Props:**

```ts
interface HeroProps {
  title: string;
  subtitle?: string;
  backgroundImage: { src: string; alt: string };
  phone: string;
}
```

**Behavior:**

- H1 headline
- Background responsive image
- Primary phone CTA button

---

### ServicesGrid.astro + ServiceCard.astro

**Type:** Astro

**Props (ServiceCard):**

```ts
interface ServiceCardProps {
  title: string;
  excerpt: string;
  image: { src: string; alt: string };
  href: string;
}
```

**Behavior:**

- Responsive grid
- Links to `/offer/[slug]`

---

### PortfolioFilters.jsx

**Type:** React Island
**Hydration:** `client:idle`

**Props:**

```ts
interface FiltersProps {
  categories: string[];
  selected?: string;
  onChange?: (category: string) => void;
}
```

**Behavior:**

- Filters projects without page reload
- Syncs query param `?category=`

---

